  "published_scope_review_verdict": "This needs the proposal route under standing requirement 5. It adds cross-function typed-use proof, complete-caller admission and shared evidence lifetime, then changes producer trial retention and every consumer's representation. The MIPS wrong-C cannot be corrected by the existing join-order hook alone. Restricting admission to existing ARM closure plus a bounded direct-transfer-only MIPS image predicate avoids a general points-to framework, but does not make this one Action/Rule-shaped pass. An ARM-only result must not be reported as fixing MIPS or closing #904.",
